hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1395","Hum se Yahya ne, unhon ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se aur Abu Salma bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne shufe ka faisla us cheez mein kya jo sharikon ke darmiyan taqseem na hui ho, phir jab un ke darmiyan haden qayam ho jain to us mein koi shufa nahi."
"1396","Malik ne kaha ke unhein riwayat pahunchi ke Saeed bin Musayyab se shufe ke bare mein pucha gaya ke kya is mein koi sunnat hai, to unhon ne kaha ke haan, shufa gharon aur zameenon mein hai aur ye sirf sharikon ke darmiyan hoti hai."
"1397","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi, unhein Sulaiman bin Yasar se isi tarah pahunchi. Malik ne aik shakhs ke bare mein kaha jis ne aik qoum ke sath zameen mein hissa kisi janwar, ghulam ya laundi ya tijarti saman mein se is jaisi kisi cheez ke badle khareeda, phir shareek apne shufe ke sath lene aaya to us ne ghulam ya laundi ko halaak paya aur kisi ko un dono ki qeemat malum na thi, to khareedar kehta hai ke ghulam ya laundi ki qeemat sau dinar hai aur shufe wala shareek kehta hai ke balke un dono ki qeemat pachaas dinar hai. Malik ne kaha ke khareedar qasam khae ke jis cheez ke badle us ne khareeda us ki qeemat sau dinar hai, phir agar shufe wala lena chahe to le le ya chhor de, magar ye ke shafee is par gawah lae ke ghulam ya laundi ki qeemat us se kam hai jo khareedar ne kaha. Malik ne kaha ke jis ne mushtaraka ghar ya zameen mein hissa hibba kya phir jise hibba kya gaya us ne use naqd ya saman mein badla diya to shareek use shufe mein le lein agar chahein aur jise hibba kya gaya use us ke badle ki qeemat dinar ya dirham mein dein. Malik ne kaha ke jis ne mushtaraka ghar ya zameen mein hibba kya phir us mein se badla na diya gaya aur na us ne us ka mutalba kya, phir us ke shareek ne use qeemat mein lene ka irada kya to ye us ke liye nahi jab tak us par badla na diya jaye, phir agar badla diya gaya to wo shafee ke liye badle ki qeemat mein hai. Malik ne aik shakhs ke bare mein kaha jis ne mushtaraka zameen mein hissa muddat wali qeemat mein khareeda phir shareek ne use shufe mein lene ka irada kya. Malik ne kaha ke agar wo maal-daar hai to use usi qeemat mein usi muddat tak shufa hai, aur agar darr ho ke wo us muddat tak qeemat ada na kare ga to jab wo un ke paas aisa zamin lae jo maal-daar aur bharose wala ho, us shakhs jaisa jis se us ne mushtaraka zameen mein hissa khareeda tha, to ye us ke liye hai. Malik ne kaha ke ghaib ke shufe ko us ki ghaibat qata nahi karti chahe us ki ghaibat lambi ho, aur hamare nazdeek is ki koi had nahi jis tak shufa qata ho. Malik ne aik shakhs ke bare mein kaha jo zameen apni aulad mein se chand afraad ko wirasat mein de phir un afraad mein se aik ke yahan bacha paida ho phir baap halaak ho jaye to mayyat ke beton mein se aik apna haq us zameen mein bech de to bechne wale ka bhai apne shufe mein apne chachaon se zyada haq-daar hai jo us ke baap ke shareek hain. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek yehi hukm hai. Malik ne kaha ke shufa sharikon ke darmiyan un ke hisson ke qadr hai, un mein se har shakhs apne nasib ke qadr le, agar thoda hai to thoda aur agar zyada hai to us ke qadr, aur ye us waqt hai jab wo is mein jhagden. Malik ne kaha ke agar koi shakhs apne sharikon mein se aik shakhs se us ka haq khareede to sharikon mein se aik kahe ke main shufe mein apne hisse ke qadr lunga, aur khareedar kahe ke agar tu chahe ke sara shufa le to main tere hawale karta hun aur agar tu chahe to chhor de, to jab khareedar use is mein ikhtiyar de aur use us ke hawale kar de to shafee ke liye sirf ye hai ke sara shufa le ya use us ke hawale kar de, phir agar us ne use le liya to wo is ka zyada haq-daar hai warna us ke liye kuchh nahi. Malik ne aik shakhs ke bare mein kaha jo zameen khareede phir use aabad kare, darkht laga kar jo us mein lagae ya kunwan jo khode, phir aik shakhs aaye aur us mein haq paye aur use shufe mein lene ka irada kare ke us ke liye is mein koi shufa nahi magar ye ke use us ki aabadi ki qeemat de, phir agar us ne use us ki aabadi ki qeemat de di to wo shufe mein zyada haq-daar hai warna us ke liye is mein koi haq nahi. Malik ne kaha ke jis ne mushtaraka zameen ya ghar mein se apna hissa becha phir jab use malum hua ke shufe wala shufe mein lega to us ne khareedar se sauda khatm karne ka mutalba kya aur us ne sauda khatm kar diya. Unhon ne kaha ke ye us ke liye nahi aur shafee us qeemat mein is ka zyada haq-daar hai jis mein us ne use becha tha. Malik ne kaha ke jis ne ghar ya zameen mein hissa aur janwar aur tijarti saman aik hi saude mein khareede phir shafee ne ghar ya zameen mein apne shufe ka mutalba kya to khareedar ne kaha ke jo kuchh maine khareeda hai sab le le kyunke maine use sab aik sath khareeda hai. Malik ne kaha ke balke shafee ghar ya zameen mein apna shufa us qeemat mein se us ke hisse ke qadr lega, har cheez jo us ne us mein se khareedi us qeemat par alag alag lagayi jaye gi jis mein us ne use khareeda, phir shafee apna shufa us qadr mein lega jo use qeemat mein se asal qeemat mein se pahunche, aur janwar aur tijarti saman mein se kuchh na lega magar ye ke wo ye chahe. Malik ne kaha ke jis ne mushtaraka zameen mein se hissa becha phir jinhein is mein shufa hai un mein se baaz ne bechne wale ke haq mein dast-bardar ho gaye aur baaz ne shufa lene ke siwa inkar kya ke jis ne dast-bardar hone se inkar kya wo sara shufa lega aur us ke liye ye nahi ke apne haq ke qadr le aur baqi chhor de. Malik ne chand afraad ke bare mein kaha jo aik hi ghar mein shareek hain, phir un mein se aik ne apna hissa becha aur us ke shareek sab ghaib hain siwa aik shakhs ke, to hazir ko pesh kya gaya ke shufe mein le ya chhore. To us ne kaha ke main apne hisse ke qadr lunga aur apne sharikon ke hisse chhorunga yahan tak ke wo aayen, phir agar unhon ne liya to theek aur agar unhon ne chhora to main sara shufa lunga. Malik ne kaha ke us ke liye sirf ye hai ke ye sab le ya chhore, phir jab us ke shareek aayen to us se lein ya chhorein agar chahein, phir jab ye us par pesh kya gaya aur us ne use qubool na kya to main us ke liye koi shufa nahi samajhta."
"1398","Yahya ne kaha ke Malik ne, unhon ne Muhammad bin Umara se, unhon ne Abu Bakr bin Hazm se riwayat kya ke Usman bin Affan ne kaha ke jab zameen mein haden qayam ho jain to is mein koi shufa nahi, aur kunwein mein koi shufa nahi aur khajoor ke nar mein koi shufa nahi. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek yehi hukm hai. Malik ne kaha ke raste mein koi shufa nahi, taqseem is mein durust ho ya durust na ho. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm ye hai ke ghar ke sehan mein koi shufa nahi, taqseem is mein durust ho ya durust na ho. Malik ne aik shakhs ke bare mein kaha jis ne mushtaraka zameen mein se hissa is shart par khareeda ke us mein use ikhtiyar hai, phir bechne wale ke sharikon ne jo un ke shareek ne becha use shufe mein lene ka irada kya is se pehle ke khareedar ikhtiyar kare ke ye un ke liye nahi hoga yahan tak ke khareedar le le aur us ke liye bai sabit ho jaye, phir jab us ke liye bai wajib ho jaye to un ke liye shufa hai. Aur Malik ne aik shakhs ke bare mein kaha jo zameen khareede phir wo us ke haath mein kuchh arsa rahe phir aik shakhs aaye aur us mein wirasat se haq paye ke us ke liye shufa hai agar us ka haq sabit ho, aur zameen ne jo paidawar di wo pehle khareedar ke liye hai us din tak jab dusre ka haq sabit ho, kyunke wo us ka zamin tha agar jo us mein darkht they wo halaak ho jate ya use sailaab le jata. Unhon ne kaha ke phir agar zamana lamba ho gaya ya gawah halaak ho gaye ya bechne wala ya khareedar mar gaya ya wo dono zinda hain phir zamane ki lambai ki wajah se bai aur khareed ki asal bhool gai to shufa munqata ho jata hai aur wo apna haq lega jo us ke liye sabit hua, aur agar us ka mamla is surat ke ilawa ho, ahad ke naye aur qareeb hone mein, aur wo samjhe ke bechne wale ne qeemat chhupayi aur use poshida rakha taake is se shufe wale ka haq qata kare to zameen ki qeemat lagayi jaye gi us qadr par jo samjha jata hai ke us ki qeemat hai, phir us ki qeemat usi tak hogi, phir dekha jaye ga ke zameen mein imarat ya darkht ya aabadi se jo izafa hua to wo usi par hoga jis par wo hai jis ne zameen maloom qeemat mein khareedi phir us mein imarat banayi aur darkht lagaye phir shufe wale ne use is ke baad liya. Malik ne kaha ke shufa mayyat ke maal mein sabit hai jaisa zinda ke maal mein hai, phir agar mayyat ke ghar wale darein ke mayyat ka maal toot jaye ga to use taqseem karein phir use bechein to un par is mein koi shufa nahi. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek ghulam mein koi shufa nahi, laundi mein, oont mein, gaye mein, bakri mein, janwar mein se kisi cheez mein, kapde mein, aur aise kunwein mein jis ke sath safed zameen na ho, shufa sirf us mein hai jo taqseem hone ke qabil ho aur us mein zameen mein se haden qayam hon, aur jo taqseem ke qabil na ho us mein koi shufa nahi. Malik ne kaha ke jis ne zameen khareedi jis mein hazir logon ke liye shufa hai to unhein Sultan ke paas le jaye, phir ya to wo mustahiq honge ya Sultan use us ke hawale kar de ga, phir agar us ne unhein chhora aur un ka mamla Sultan ke paas na uthaya aur unhein us ki khareed ka ilm ho gaya phir unhon ne use chhora yahan tak ke us ka zamana lamba ho gaya phir wo apne shufe ka mutalba karne aaye to main ye un ke liye nahi samajhta."
